  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CERN Summer Studentships 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CERN Summer Studentships .  Sponsoring graduate level summer studentships from &gt;30 LMIC countries to experience CERN life, working mostly on the ATLAS and CMS detectors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
